WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.380 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 5]

01:48.480 --> 01:49.020
Sir,

01:49.680 --> 01:50.540
are you ready?

01:52.870 --> 01:53.410
Yes.

01:54.560 --> 01:55.540
Please start.

02:02.150 --> 02:03.820
It's already this bad.

02:26.590 --> 02:27.010
Mu Bai.

02:27.560 --> 02:28.500
Did you kill Chou the Ox?

02:28.800 --> 02:29.450
I did.

02:30.030 --> 02:30.770
What of it?

02:31.150 --> 02:31.940
Then today,

02:32.360 --> 02:33.260
we'll avenge him!

02:40.180 --> 02:40.910
Split up!

02:53.190 --> 02:54.220
Xie Huxiao of the Xie family,

02:54.840 --> 02:56.570
your edge isn't what it was.

02:57.680 --> 02:58.980
He inherits the Dragonfang Saber.

02:59.400 --> 02:59.940
Huxiao,

03:00.870 --> 03:02.690
looks like the Xies have produced

03:02.750 --> 03:04.010
a killer sharper than us.

03:04.680 --> 03:05.410
You're Buxie?

03:06.080 --> 03:06.940
You've grown this much?

03:07.750 --> 03:08.350
Back then, the very first

03:08.350 --> 03:10.130
to teach me the blade was you.

03:11.240 --> 03:12.220
I've waited for this fight

03:12.840 --> 03:13.540
a long time.

03:13.960 --> 03:14.940
That little blade fanatic

03:15.430 --> 03:17.130
has become a true blade fanatic.

03:37.960 --> 03:39.340
No idea where Su Muyu is.

03:41.150 --> 03:41.890
Don't keep thinking

03:41.960 --> 03:42.850
about your dream boy.

03:43.360 --> 03:44.570
We're here on business.

03:47.910 --> 03:49.450
The Mu family's fake diviner is here?

03:50.080 --> 03:50.660
Fine.

03:51.680 --> 03:52.940
Then let me do a quick reading.

03:53.240 --> 03:53.890
How will

03:54.360 --> 03:55.130
this fight end?

04:00.840 --> 04:01.540
Ah, the blossom side's up,

04:02.520 --> 04:03.130
a sign of good luck!

04:04.710 --> 04:05.380
Fraud.

04:05.710 --> 04:06.380
Get over yourself!

04:27.800 --> 04:28.220
Senior.

04:31.390 --> 04:32.220
Do you think

04:33.270 --> 04:34.700
they can break in?

04:36.390 --> 04:37.050
They must have made

04:37.070 --> 04:38.220
very thorough preparations.

04:39.160 --> 04:40.100
And among us...

04:41.190 --> 04:42.220
they have an insider.

04:45.920 --> 04:46.580
I haven't contacted

04:46.920 --> 04:48.250
Blood River headquarters

04:48.950 --> 04:50.030
for many years

04:50.040 --> 04:51.140
to this day.

04:53.600 --> 04:54.850
Perhaps I already

04:56.120 --> 04:57.460
switched to the enemy's side?

04:58.310 --> 04:59.050
I believe you, Senior.

05:02.190 --> 05:03.810
I thought

05:04.430 --> 05:06.140
you had long put me

05:06.950 --> 05:08.780
on the kill list.

05:10.870 --> 05:11.610
Backed into a corner,

05:12.750 --> 05:14.100
sometimes we're powerless.

05:15.070 --> 05:15.700
All we can do

05:16.120 --> 05:17.140
is trust each other.

05:18.630 --> 05:20.370
I trust you the most.

05:20.680 --> 05:22.290
Even if I betray the Spider Shadow Sect,

05:23.310 --> 05:24.490
I believe you'll still stand

05:24.510 --> 05:25.810
by the Patriarch.

05:32.430 --> 05:33.540
What a...

05:35.360 --> 05:37.170
moving speech.

05:42.070 --> 05:43.100
So moving

05:45.240 --> 05:47.170
that I should die for it.

06:08.480 --> 06:09.020
It's the spear array!

06:37.240 --> 06:37.610
Qingyang,

06:37.830 --> 06:38.490
hold them off a while.

06:38.800 --> 06:39.370
I'll go find Muyu.

06:40.560 --> 06:41.220
You're so faithless!

06:53.270 --> 06:53.980
What are you waiting for?

06:54.600 --> 06:55.460
Kill them now.

06:56.360 --> 06:57.170
This isn't a spar.

06:57.800 --> 06:59.250
It's life and death.

06:59.750 --> 07:00.900
I'm not here to kill.

07:01.390 --> 07:02.410
And I told you

07:02.950 --> 07:03.540
I'm here

07:04.360 --> 07:05.810
only to find Su Muyu.

07:06.870 --> 07:07.540
Besides,

07:08.000 --> 07:09.250
they're from Xie family too.

07:10.160 --> 07:11.100
We all knew each other.

07:12.000 --> 07:13.700
The day they joined the Spider Shadow Sect,

07:14.270 --> 07:14.930
they were

07:15.480 --> 07:17.220
no longer of the Xie family.

07:22.480 --> 07:23.410
To join the Spider Shadow Sect

07:24.160 --> 07:25.930
is every Blood River warrior's honor.

07:26.680 --> 07:27.370
And they

07:28.040 --> 07:29.050
should have been

07:29.630 --> 07:31.460
your Xie family's pride!

07:33.160 --> 07:34.610
Should I call you Mr. Luo

07:35.430 --> 07:36.340
or Mr. Ke?

07:36.630 --> 07:38.170
My master mentioned you.

07:38.480 --> 07:39.490
I've heard a lot.

07:40.070 --> 07:41.170
Go find Su Muyu.

07:41.630 --> 07:42.780
I'll hold him off.

07:57.240 --> 07:57.810
The array's core is here!

08:07.560 --> 08:08.050
All right.

08:09.120 --> 08:09.930
We can move on now.

08:11.000 --> 08:12.100
No one is leaving!

08:35.320 --> 08:37.010
Soul-Swap Technique.

09:00.320 --> 09:01.700
So the Patriarch's inner world looks like this.

09:02.750 --> 09:04.940
It's literal hell.

09:26.750 --> 09:27.890
What bug is that?

09:29.120 --> 09:30.580
It disturbed me.

09:34.200 --> 09:35.220
That's the old master's

09:35.240 --> 09:37.130
messenger dagger.

09:38.670 --> 09:39.340
Changhe,

09:40.030 --> 09:41.300
he's urging you...

09:41.480 --> 09:42.010
Nope.

09:44.030 --> 09:45.130
Let me nap.

09:50.390 --> 09:51.530
You little brat,

09:52.240 --> 09:53.420
you're laying a board, huh?

09:58.510 --> 10:00.100
You're the sharp one, Uncle Zhe.

10:01.000 --> 10:02.580
They're all inside my setup,

10:03.390 --> 10:04.770
just waiting for me to...

10:05.670 --> 10:06.730
reap the reward.

10:20.000 --> 10:20.580
Su Muyu!

10:21.360 --> 10:22.180
I haven't met you.

10:23.030 --> 10:23.700
Looks like the Xie family

10:23.720 --> 10:25.130
hid a fine killer.

10:25.440 --> 10:26.580
I often asked my master

10:27.000 --> 10:28.100
how my blade work was.

10:28.670 --> 10:29.370
He always said

10:30.270 --> 10:30.980
my blade skills

10:31.360 --> 10:32.420
are already first

10:32.630 --> 10:33.530
among this generation.

10:34.630 --> 10:35.180
But compared

10:35.200 --> 10:36.730
with the sword-first Su Muyu,

10:37.150 --> 10:38.460
there's still a long gap.

10:39.550 --> 10:40.300
Who is your master?

10:41.630 --> 10:42.180
Xie Qidao

10:42.750 --> 10:43.420
from the Xie family.

10:44.240 --> 10:44.940
Uncle Qidao

10:44.960 --> 10:46.060
is a fine teacher.

10:46.510 --> 10:47.650
You're his disciple...

10:48.120 --> 10:49.420
No wonder you got this far.

10:51.080 --> 10:52.460
Keep your compliments.

10:53.480 --> 10:54.850
The best praise for me

10:55.320 --> 10:56.490
is a fight!

10:59.790 --> 11:00.370
Su Muyu,

11:00.840 --> 11:01.530
stand down here.

11:01.790 --> 11:02.300
Xuewei,

11:03.390 --> 11:03.940
you're here.

11:04.240 --> 11:04.770
Do not interrupt

11:04.790 --> 11:05.730
our duel.

11:06.000 --> 11:06.850
If you interfere,

11:07.550 --> 11:08.580
I'll kill you!

11:09.270 --> 11:10.220
You're threatening me?

11:10.960 --> 11:11.770
Just a warning.

11:12.320 --> 11:13.420
As you wish!

11:15.240 --> 11:16.300
I'm here to fight with your sword,

11:16.750 --> 11:17.820
not a shabby umbrella!

11:18.720 --> 11:20.060
The umbrella is my sword.

11:20.240 --> 11:21.220
You know what I expect.

11:21.720 --> 11:22.100
Do I

11:22.510 --> 11:23.300
lack the standing

11:23.360 --> 11:24.770
to see your Eighteen-Sword Array?

11:25.600 --> 11:26.530
Use your blade

11:27.840 --> 11:28.850
to witness my sword.

11:34.910 --> 11:35.460
Fine!

11:41.000 --> 11:41.770
Still-Arms Technique...

11:42.510 --> 11:43.700
The Xie family's secret art,

11:43.790 --> 11:44.490
near-invincible.

11:46.440 --> 11:47.060
Su Muyu, careful!

12:35.630 --> 12:36.420
Reveal your real skills,

12:36.870 --> 12:38.060
or you'll die under my blade!

12:38.390 --> 12:39.980
Your blade work is superb.

12:41.030 --> 12:42.490
No wonder Uncle Qidao called you

12:42.550 --> 12:43.890
this era's top bladesman.

12:45.550 --> 12:46.250
But his other line

12:46.270 --> 12:47.340
is also true.

12:48.510 --> 12:49.010
What?

12:49.510 --> 12:50.940
The gap between us

12:52.030 --> 12:53.300
is a chasm.

12:54.720 --> 12:55.890
Eighteen-Sword Array, activate!

13:25.120 --> 13:26.300
So this is the Eighteen-Sword Array.

13:29.600 --> 13:30.460
One person alone

13:30.910 --> 13:32.300
can command so many blades.

14:02.480 --> 14:03.180
This old man

14:03.840 --> 14:05.530
who sometimes looks kindly and gentle...

14:06.000 --> 14:07.490
what past does he really carry?

14:12.360 --> 14:12.980
Who's there?

14:17.390 --> 14:18.300
Tonight...

14:19.630 --> 14:21.370
If we both die here,

14:22.910 --> 14:23.650
are you afraid?

14:24.600 --> 14:25.700
Die here...

14:26.200 --> 14:27.850
Don't talk about death.

14:28.360 --> 14:28.940
Sir,

14:29.390 --> 14:30.650
let me finish this drag.

14:32.030 --> 14:33.730
Then I'll go out and wipe them out!

14:36.790 --> 14:37.340
Su Zhe,

14:38.600 --> 14:39.180
I give you my word.

14:39.870 --> 14:40.650
If this time

14:40.870 --> 14:42.130
we make it out alive,

14:42.630 --> 14:44.700
I'll allow you to leave Blood River for a while

14:46.480 --> 14:48.100
to see your wife and daughter.

14:48.510 --> 14:49.610
Only for a while?

14:52.080 --> 14:53.010
Wife...

14:54.790 --> 14:55.460
And daughter...

15:13.720 --> 15:14.300
Sir...

15:15.390 --> 15:16.530
After today,

15:17.440 --> 15:18.650
consider this term's Kui

15:18.750 --> 15:19.530
already dead.

15:21.200 --> 15:22.100
Kui?

15:24.550 --> 15:25.980
I hate this role.

15:27.120 --> 15:28.460
I'm leaving Blood River.

15:32.480 --> 15:34.010
I want to be with my wife

15:35.120 --> 15:36.250
and daughter for life,

15:37.790 --> 15:40.610
live together, happy.

15:51.840 --> 15:52.650
My dear...

16:32.910 --> 16:34.100
I poisoned him,

16:35.790 --> 16:36.820
and left a mark.

16:38.720 --> 16:40.100
Even if he cures it,

16:40.870 --> 16:41.730
he will forever

16:41.790 --> 16:43.180
carry that mark.

16:44.750 --> 16:46.490
Even if he flees to the ends of the earth,

16:48.030 --> 16:48.980
even if his whole life

16:49.000 --> 16:50.130
he never dares face me,

16:52.960 --> 16:54.610
he still won't forget me.

16:57.480 --> 16:58.420
So it's you.

16:59.790 --> 17:00.490
So...

17:02.150 --> 17:03.770
I'd already met you.

17:18.880 --> 17:19.660
Who are you?

17:29.310 --> 17:29.860
I...

17:33.480 --> 17:34.570
You can see me?

17:37.240 --> 17:38.010
Has the Patriarch's

17:38.590 --> 17:40.010
self-awareness in this illusion

17:40.310 --> 17:41.090
awakened?

17:42.920 --> 17:43.490
Oh no!

17:47.000 --> 17:47.600
Who...

17:49.160 --> 17:49.860
exactly are you?

17:50.240 --> 17:50.660
This...

17:51.720 --> 17:52.620
this is a dream.

17:53.640 --> 17:54.330
A dream?

17:54.920 --> 17:55.530
Yes!

17:56.400 --> 17:56.770
I...

17:57.110 --> 17:58.530
I am only a figure

17:58.720 --> 17:59.570
passing through your dream.

18:02.400 --> 18:02.860
Right.

18:04.030 --> 18:04.810
That's it.

18:06.200 --> 18:07.090
Back away slowly.

18:07.960 --> 18:09.570
Just slip out of his sight.

18:10.960 --> 18:11.730
Who sent you?

18:17.480 --> 18:18.330
Phantom Step.

18:19.030 --> 18:20.180
You're of the Su family.

18:20.790 --> 18:23.140
But the Su family dared betray me!

18:28.070 --> 18:28.660
Too bad.

18:29.440 --> 18:30.900
If I'm killed in this illusion,

18:31.160 --> 18:32.700
will the real me die?

18:33.590 --> 18:35.010
Master never taught me this.

18:35.920 --> 18:36.380
No.

18:37.030 --> 18:38.730
The Su family betrayed me long ago.

18:41.440 --> 18:42.380
Only Su Muyu

18:42.480 --> 18:43.490
still stands with me.

18:46.310 --> 18:46.980
Why am I

18:47.000 --> 18:48.460
still so surprised?

18:52.960 --> 18:53.570
Could it be

18:54.270 --> 18:55.570
his present memories

18:56.440 --> 18:57.900
are affecting

18:58.270 --> 18:59.760
his former self in here?

19:00.550 --> 19:01.660
Who are you really?

19:03.070 --> 19:03.570
I...

19:04.550 --> 19:05.570
I'm Bai Hehuai.

19:05.880 --> 19:07.250
the miracle physician treating you.

19:08.110 --> 19:08.700
I came

19:09.110 --> 19:09.940
to search

19:10.350 --> 19:11.620
for a way to cure you!

19:13.480 --> 19:14.900
But you use Su family arts.

19:15.480 --> 19:16.460
You're lying to me!

19:27.160 --> 19:27.940
So it turns out

19:28.680 --> 19:30.010
being killed in the illusion

19:30.440 --> 19:31.900
just gets you thrown out.

20:04.880 --> 20:06.180
I'll ask again

20:06.830 --> 20:08.220
the question from before.

20:12.550 --> 20:13.140
Who...

20:14.240 --> 20:15.250
are you really?

20:20.790 --> 20:21.900
The Eighteen-Sword Array is up.

20:22.400 --> 20:23.770
Can you break through my array?

20:24.240 --> 20:25.730
I don't see a way to crack it.

20:26.590 --> 20:27.180
But...

20:28.000 --> 20:29.330
only obstacles you can't cross

20:30.070 --> 20:31.010
make crossing meaningful,

20:31.070 --> 20:31.570
right?

20:32.510 --> 20:33.980
Only winning a doomed game

20:34.720 --> 20:35.700
gives winning meaning.

20:36.400 --> 20:37.290
You're a blade fanatic.

20:38.000 --> 20:38.700
Maybe.

20:39.310 --> 20:40.460
Master says so too.

20:41.070 --> 20:41.810
What about you, Lord Kui?

20:42.440 --> 20:43.250
Are you a sword fanatic?

20:44.070 --> 20:45.250
A sword is just a weapon.

20:46.240 --> 20:47.660
Cling too hard to the sword itself

20:48.240 --> 20:49.770
and you become its slave.

20:50.350 --> 20:51.220
Did a Blood River master

20:51.240 --> 20:51.980
tell you that?

20:52.550 --> 20:52.980
No.

20:53.640 --> 20:54.180
These words

20:55.400 --> 20:57.420
were carved on No-Sword City's wall.

21:06.000 --> 21:06.980
You've practiced from dawn to dusk.

21:07.830 --> 21:09.290
You're really

21:09.310 --> 21:10.660
[Zhuo Yuluo from No-Sword City]
a persistent kid.

21:11.200 --> 21:11.980
Because I want to become

21:12.000 --> 21:13.250
as skilled as you, Father.

21:14.240 --> 21:14.810
Oh, Father,

21:15.240 --> 21:17.010
Third Uncle lives for the sword.

21:17.440 --> 21:18.220
So why

21:18.400 --> 21:19.570
you've long reached the Heaven level

21:19.880 --> 21:20.490
while he's still stuck

21:20.510 --> 21:21.490
at the Earth level?

21:22.110 --> 21:22.700
Because

21:23.350 --> 21:24.860
his heart holds nothing but practice.

21:25.240 --> 21:25.700
That's why

21:25.920 --> 21:26.730
he can't move forward.

21:27.920 --> 21:28.730
I don't get it.

21:29.240 --> 21:30.380
Father, what do you have in your heart

21:30.400 --> 21:31.380
that he doesn't?

21:31.830 --> 21:32.570
Silly child,

21:33.160 --> 21:34.700
I have you in mine.

21:37.830 --> 21:39.570
Your devotion to the blade is pure,

21:40.640 --> 21:41.770
but why must you beat me?

21:43.240 --> 21:44.810
Just to be stronger than I?

21:46.720 --> 21:48.330
If all you see is strong vs. weak,

21:51.310 --> 21:52.180
then your blade

21:55.310 --> 21:56.810
will never be the strongest.

21:59.440 --> 22:00.050
Win or lose,

22:00.350 --> 22:01.700
that's what gives meaning to me!

22:25.160 --> 22:25.700
This strike...

22:26.550 --> 22:27.460
It deserves respect.

22:44.000 --> 22:45.620
Does Eighteen-Sword Array mean

22:45.680 --> 22:46.620
only eighteen swords?

22:47.480 --> 22:49.330
Why not one hundred eighty,

22:49.880 --> 22:51.140
one thousand eight hundred?

23:04.680 --> 23:05.980
Or eighteen thousand?

23:28.750 --> 23:29.490
What was

23:29.920 --> 23:30.420
that last strike called?

23:31.200 --> 23:32.250
Flying blades scattered,

23:32.590 --> 23:33.490
like evening rain.

23:33.880 --> 23:35.010
Long sword strikes,

23:35.880 --> 23:36.730
like unstoppable rainbow.

23:37.200 --> 23:38.570
That strike takes my name,

23:38.920 --> 23:39.620
Muyu.

23:40.310 --> 23:41.220
You name it after yourself?

23:43.400 --> 23:44.770
Someday I'll forge a technique

23:45.350 --> 23:46.090
named after myself, Buxie.

23:47.680 --> 23:48.730
You're devoted to the blade,

23:49.240 --> 23:50.090
obsessed with it.

23:50.750 --> 23:51.700
Everything you fight for

23:51.750 --> 23:52.620
is for the blade.

23:53.440 --> 23:54.490
But a blade is dead steel.

23:56.070 --> 23:57.050
You need to find

23:58.030 --> 23:59.660
the cause and the reason

23:59.720 --> 24:00.620
that's truly worth dying for.

24:01.200 --> 24:01.810
A reason?

24:04.200 --> 24:04.860
I don't get it.

24:05.590 --> 24:06.940
Like how I must defeat you,

24:08.310 --> 24:09.250
because I can't lose.

24:10.030 --> 24:11.050
I still don't get you.

24:12.510 --> 24:13.660
But to beat you,

24:14.310 --> 24:15.250
I'll try to find it.

24:19.200 --> 24:19.980
You're leaving?

24:20.550 --> 24:21.290
I said earlier

24:21.830 --> 24:22.460
I didn't come here

24:23.070 --> 24:24.090
to kill anyone.

24:34.790 --> 24:35.330
Xuewei,

24:36.160 --> 24:37.660
don't tell me you want a fight too?

24:38.070 --> 24:38.900
Fight my foot.

24:41.680 --> 24:42.290
You're bleeding.

24:44.070 --> 24:44.810
Treat it now.

24:47.400 --> 24:48.620
I don't dare use your meds.

24:50.270 --> 24:51.810
I've got a young miracle physician with me now.

24:52.480 --> 24:53.220
I won't dare use

24:53.240 --> 24:54.620
your medicine that can kill a cow.

24:55.480 --> 24:56.730
Your young miracle physician?

24:57.590 --> 24:58.980
You sure she's still alive?

25:02.440 --> 25:03.220
If you want to save her,

25:03.550 --> 25:04.730
break my poison array first.

25:05.590 --> 25:06.050
Xuewei,

25:06.750 --> 25:07.460
you know clearly

25:07.510 --> 25:08.460
this array won't hold me long.

25:10.790 --> 25:11.330
Sir,

25:12.440 --> 25:13.050
trust me.

25:13.790 --> 25:14.730
I mean no harm.

25:15.640 --> 25:17.380
You wield Su family arts.

25:18.000 --> 25:19.460
You use this Soul-Swap Technique

25:19.590 --> 25:20.380
not to detox me

25:20.400 --> 25:21.570
at all,

25:22.160 --> 25:23.220
but to pry

25:23.310 --> 25:25.420
into my mind's secrets!

25:27.270 --> 25:28.420
Trying to learn

25:28.440 --> 25:30.140
Blood River's secrets?

25:30.250 --> 25:31.530
Did those fools

25:31.590 --> 25:32.980
from the Three Families ever tell you?

25:33.480 --> 25:34.330
Some secrets

25:34.720 --> 25:36.220
kill faster

25:36.370 --> 25:38.340
the more you know!

25:48.160 --> 25:48.810
Sir...

25:55.490 --> 25:56.270
Die!

26:14.790 --> 26:16.090
Mu Xuewei

26:17.960 --> 26:19.420
of the Mu family?

26:26.440 --> 26:27.940
Su family's Three-Needle Threading.

26:28.310 --> 26:28.900
Who are you really?

26:28.920 --> 26:29.620
Don't even know who I am,

26:29.790 --> 26:30.660
and you struck that hard!

26:34.510 --> 26:34.980
Trap.

26:39.750 --> 26:40.180
Oh no.

26:40.550 --> 26:41.530
They've breached the rear courtyard.

26:50.920 --> 26:51.570
Su Muyu, you liar!

26:51.750 --> 26:52.460
You promised with you here,

26:52.680 --> 26:53.570
I'd be safe and sound!

26:58.960 --> 26:59.460
Physician!

27:06.480 --> 27:06.980
Su Muyu!

27:07.240 --> 27:07.980
Why are you going down there?

27:08.160 --> 27:09.220
I just found him.

27:09.240 --> 27:10.050
I don't want to die yet!

27:10.070 --> 27:10.700
Physician, don't panic!

27:24.070 --> 27:24.940
You really came.

27:25.680 --> 27:26.530
I promised you.

27:27.310 --> 27:27.810
With me here,

27:28.720 --> 27:29.330
you'll be safe.

27:55.070 --> 27:56.090
That's high.

27:56.550 --> 27:57.730
How do we get across?

28:09.270 --> 28:10.460
That stone gate weighs a ton.

28:11.350 --> 28:12.250
My palm force won't budge it.

28:39.920 --> 28:40.570
Xuewei

28:41.110 --> 28:41.900
pays respects to you, Sir.

28:50.200 --> 28:50.980
Sleep smoke...

28:54.110 --> 28:54.620
Let's move.

29:11.240 --> 29:11.660
Don't rush.

29:16.030 --> 29:16.570
Oh no!

29:17.160 --> 29:17.860
I'm doomed!

29:18.070 --> 29:18.940
I forgot it.

29:19.270 --> 29:19.980
What now?

29:20.070 --> 29:21.420
I'm really going to die of poison.

29:22.830 --> 29:23.420
Antidote!

29:24.680 --> 29:25.290
Hurry!

29:25.310 --> 29:26.450
Or I'll actually die soon.

29:33.640 --> 29:34.290
You're losing outside?

29:36.590 --> 29:37.530
Twelve Zodiacs of Spider Shadow

29:37.830 --> 29:39.220
aren't that easy to handle.

29:39.920 --> 29:40.570
At most,

29:40.920 --> 29:42.140
we can hold for a while.

29:43.440 --> 29:44.770
Where's that kid from Xie family?

29:45.920 --> 29:46.490
He left.

29:47.000 --> 29:47.810
Left?

29:49.070 --> 29:49.770
What about Su Muyu?

29:51.640 --> 29:52.570
He jumped into that pit

29:53.590 --> 29:55.250
with the miracle physician from Medicine King Valley.

30:01.400 --> 30:01.900
Perfect.

30:02.480 --> 30:03.220
Toss poison down there,

30:03.440 --> 30:04.320
the deadliest kind.

30:04.920 --> 30:05.460
Are you insane?

30:05.830 --> 30:06.730
Su Muyu is still inside!

30:09.160 --> 30:10.530
You gave him an antidote,

30:10.880 --> 30:12.180
sealed in his sword hilt.

30:12.550 --> 30:13.770
You think I don't know about it?

30:15.000 --> 30:15.700
Poison them.

30:16.070 --> 30:17.380
We can't miss this chance!

30:18.440 --> 30:19.250
Su Muyu doesn't have to die,

30:19.960 --> 30:21.490
but that physician must die today!

30:22.310 --> 30:24.010
Hurry!

30:36.200 --> 30:36.660
Careful.

30:37.030 --> 30:37.730
Why?

30:37.960 --> 30:38.460
It's poison.

30:43.510 --> 30:44.010
Take it.

30:45.160 --> 30:46.010
I know it's poison.

30:46.480 --> 30:47.220
I mean,

30:47.310 --> 30:48.050
why should I be careful?

30:48.680 --> 30:49.490
I'm from Medicine King Valley,

30:49.510 --> 30:50.730
the Valley Lord's junior,

30:50.920 --> 30:52.250
and the Wen family head's granddaughter.

30:52.590 --> 30:53.380
You think I'm scared of poison?

31:17.400 --> 31:18.010
Classic you,

31:18.070 --> 31:19.090
really are full of surprises.

31:20.790 --> 31:21.380
But...

31:21.960 --> 31:22.730
what poison art

31:23.110 --> 31:24.660
did that lady train?

31:24.880 --> 31:25.530
She makes herself

31:25.550 --> 31:26.620
out-and-out poisonous.

31:27.790 --> 31:28.700
When Xuewei was little,

31:28.720 --> 31:29.660
she learned the Poison-Sand Palm.

31:30.350 --> 31:30.980
Sharp eye, physician.

31:31.590 --> 31:32.810
You spotted it at once.

31:33.480 --> 31:34.290
Once we're out,

31:34.790 --> 31:35.530
I'll fill you in

31:36.200 --> 31:37.180
on the details.

31:37.480 --> 31:38.460
For now, the priority

31:38.790 --> 31:40.050
is getting back to the Patriarch.

31:41.440 --> 31:42.770
Although I've destroyed the blade

31:43.310 --> 31:44.330
that breached Spider's Nest,

31:45.070 --> 31:46.530
Changhe hasn't even moved yet.

31:48.240 --> 31:50.050
The Wen family has plenty

31:50.270 --> 31:50.900
who practice poison arts,

31:51.720 --> 31:52.490
but more often than not,

31:52.680 --> 31:53.730
they poison themselves

31:54.200 --> 31:55.490
before they kill others.

31:56.640 --> 31:57.860
Still, that Poison-Sand Palm

31:58.160 --> 31:58.770
isn't exactly

31:58.790 --> 32:00.010
some complex art.

32:00.880 --> 32:02.050
She must've slipped in training.

32:02.240 --> 32:03.530
Some mishap, who knows,

32:03.920 --> 32:05.490
that spread venom through her body.

32:07.000 --> 32:07.940
By rights,

32:08.200 --> 32:09.180
she shouldn't have survived.

32:10.070 --> 32:11.330
She must've been saved

32:11.400 --> 32:13.220
by something miraculous.

32:15.920 --> 32:16.940
Looks like I guessed right.

32:17.720 --> 32:18.180
Even so,

32:18.480 --> 32:19.620
though she lived,

32:19.960 --> 32:20.810
the poison remains.

32:22.070 --> 32:24.420
If someone carelessly brushes

32:25.310 --> 32:26.660
against her,

32:27.400 --> 32:28.570
they'll die miserably

32:29.160 --> 32:30.700
in a short time.

32:34.920 --> 32:35.460
Can you cure her?

32:36.270 --> 32:37.980
She tried to kill me on sight!

32:38.310 --> 32:39.570
Even after I dove into this secret passage,

32:39.790 --> 32:40.810
she sent a poisonous blossom

32:40.830 --> 32:41.570
chasing after me.

32:42.110 --> 32:43.530
And you want her saved now?

32:44.000 --> 32:44.530
That doesn't track.

32:46.110 --> 32:46.570
Sorry.

32:47.590 --> 32:49.460
She's steeped in venom,

32:50.200 --> 32:51.050
but she's gentle,

32:51.720 --> 32:53.140
keeps her distance from people

32:53.680 --> 32:54.980
for fear of harming them.

32:55.720 --> 32:56.900
If she struck at you,

32:57.590 --> 32:58.050
it was likely

32:58.070 --> 32:59.050
under family orders.

33:01.140 --> 33:02.480
Su Muyu,

33:02.550 --> 33:04.190
I'm honestly curious

33:04.400 --> 33:05.140
what kind of

33:05.200 --> 33:06.420
softhearted idealist you are.

33:06.640 --> 33:08.220
She truly meant to kill me.

33:08.220 --> 33:09.300
I could feel it.

33:10.550 --> 33:12.010
As for why...

33:13.030 --> 33:14.090
no idea.

33:19.270 --> 33:19.660
Fine.

33:20.920 --> 33:22.420
If after this,

33:22.720 --> 33:23.290
she and I

33:23.790 --> 33:24.570
are both alive

33:25.000 --> 33:25.860
and no longer enemies,

33:26.680 --> 33:27.380
I can cure her.

33:28.350 --> 33:28.940
One condition,

33:29.350 --> 33:29.940
simple...

33:31.480 --> 33:32.330
We'll pay enough.

33:33.030 --> 33:34.010
No wonder you're Blood River's Kui!

33:34.400 --> 33:35.570
You catch on fast.

33:37.400 --> 33:39.380
Then, Lord Kui,

33:39.960 --> 33:41.290
how do we get out?

33:44.830 --> 33:46.090
While we spoke,

33:46.750 --> 33:47.420
I thought it through.

33:48.110 --> 33:49.420
The mechanism should be at these two spots.

34:14.370 --> 34:15.740
Let's move.

34:17.840 --> 34:18.980
It looks kinda scary.

34:20.110 --> 34:21.260
No traps, right?

34:22.630 --> 34:23.130
No.

34:23.840 --> 34:24.740
This is the escape route.

34:25.510 --> 34:26.170
No more

34:26.190 --> 34:27.010
tricks ahead.

34:36.700 --> 34:40.820
[Luojiuxiao Inn]

35:02.580 --> 35:04.460
[Shore]

35:08.550 --> 35:09.130
Uncle Zhe,

35:09.960 --> 35:10.980
time to work!

35:19.880 --> 35:20.690
Bad luck.

35:22.230 --> 35:22.940
Easy, master.

35:23.800 --> 35:24.740
What's there to fear?

35:27.110 --> 35:29.010
I just can't stand that crow,

35:29.030 --> 35:30.340
so I cursed it.

35:31.000 --> 35:32.090
Sons of the Su family

35:32.800 --> 35:34.300
can't be timid.

35:35.150 --> 35:35.610
Yes.

35:39.230 --> 35:39.650
Sir.

35:41.360 --> 35:42.260
Any news?

35:42.630 --> 35:43.650
Xie and Mu joined up

35:44.110 --> 35:45.340
and stormed Spider's Nest.

35:45.800 --> 35:46.360
So far

35:46.360 --> 35:47.610
they haven't taken the Dormant Dragon Sword.

35:48.030 --> 35:49.380
But the Nest's defenses

35:49.550 --> 35:50.780
are breached.

35:55.670 --> 35:57.210
Those two old foxes

35:58.280 --> 36:00.010
actually teamed up.

36:01.760 --> 36:02.780
What about Su Changhe?

36:03.710 --> 36:05.010
I wanted him to move at once.

36:05.030 --> 36:06.530
Did the messenger dagger reach him?

36:07.510 --> 36:08.130
He rejected it.

36:09.070 --> 36:10.090
He rejected?

36:10.280 --> 36:10.860
Sir,

36:11.360 --> 36:12.300
Su Changhe

36:12.590 --> 36:14.050
just won't fight Su Muyu.

36:14.550 --> 36:15.090
If you ask me,

36:15.590 --> 36:16.650
give me command.

36:17.280 --> 36:18.530
I'll lead a strike now

36:19.150 --> 36:20.820
and seize the Dormant Dragon Sword!

36:21.480 --> 36:22.460
Only Su Changhe

36:22.480 --> 36:23.380
can handle Su Muyu.

36:24.070 --> 36:25.380
And only if our Su family

36:25.800 --> 36:26.610
wins the Dormant Dragon Sword,

36:26.960 --> 36:28.690
and holds both Su Muyu

36:28.920 --> 36:30.260
and Su Changhe,

36:30.670 --> 36:31.780
will Xie and Mu

36:32.550 --> 36:34.260
be kept in check.

36:36.590 --> 36:37.900
You mean...

36:39.150 --> 36:39.530
Sir,

36:39.960 --> 36:41.030
Su Changhe and Uncle Zhe

36:41.030 --> 36:42.380
have left Luojiuxiao Inn.

36:50.880 --> 36:53.380
It's moonrise again.

37:01.840 --> 37:02.940
Did you cure

37:03.800 --> 37:04.900
the Patriarch's poison?

37:06.150 --> 37:08.130
It's suppressed for now.

37:08.800 --> 37:09.860
After performing the Soul-Swap Technique

37:09.880 --> 37:11.260
on the Patriarch,

37:11.760 --> 37:13.570
I've got some idea

37:14.150 --> 37:15.340
how to treat the poison.

37:17.400 --> 37:18.130
My thanks, physician.

37:23.030 --> 37:23.530
Lord Kui,

37:24.320 --> 37:25.210
I suddenly remembered something.

37:25.760 --> 37:26.300
That day,

37:26.440 --> 37:27.650
leaving the Medicine Hall,

37:28.190 --> 37:29.490
I met a man at the gate

37:29.510 --> 37:30.490
with a staff in hand.

37:31.360 --> 37:33.210
Was he from your Su family?

37:34.550 --> 37:35.300
That was Uncle Zhe.

37:38.960 --> 37:39.820
He was...

37:41.590 --> 37:42.820
the previous Kui, right?

37:47.280 --> 37:48.420
Looks like you already found

37:48.440 --> 37:49.460
the answer yourself.

37:50.590 --> 37:51.530
Won't you ask me

37:51.960 --> 37:53.380
why I need to know?

37:54.190 --> 37:55.050
That's your secret.

37:55.960 --> 37:56.650
I won't pry.

37:57.230 --> 37:57.900
Didn't you say

37:58.360 --> 37:59.300
Blood River's Kui

37:59.760 --> 38:00.900
guard the Patriarch

38:00.920 --> 38:01.980
to the death?

38:02.840 --> 38:03.690
Then why

38:04.110 --> 38:05.300
could he step down?

38:07.110 --> 38:07.860
No one knows.

38:08.480 --> 38:09.320
It's a secret

38:09.550 --> 38:11.140
between Uncle Zhe and the Patriarch.

38:12.030 --> 38:12.610
I know!

38:15.150 --> 38:16.610
In the Patriarch's memories,

38:17.000 --> 38:17.490
I saw it.

38:19.000 --> 38:21.260
To protect him,

38:21.760 --> 38:22.780
Uncle Zhe was badly hurt.

38:23.590 --> 38:24.420
So the Patriarch

38:24.510 --> 38:25.380
gave his word:

38:25.880 --> 38:27.340
if they both survived,

38:27.800 --> 38:28.490
he'd allow him

38:28.840 --> 38:29.940
to lay down the title of Kui

38:30.440 --> 38:31.130
and return him

38:32.190 --> 38:32.530
his freedom.

38:36.190 --> 38:37.420
Only somehow,

38:38.840 --> 38:39.820
even then he didn't leave.

38:42.800 --> 38:44.090
There's a secret passage in Spider's Nest.

38:44.360 --> 38:45.300
It's long.

38:45.710 --> 38:47.300
It runs straight to Sanli Pavilion outside the city.

38:47.920 --> 38:48.340
Uncle Zhe,

38:49.030 --> 38:50.380
how about we split up?

38:50.670 --> 38:51.790
You wait at Sanli Pavilion

38:51.840 --> 38:52.860
and kill that young miracle physician.

38:53.400 --> 38:55.130
I'll hit Spider's Nest and take the Dormant Dragon Sword.

38:57.920 --> 38:59.460
So many experts in the Su family,

38:59.920 --> 39:01.340
why is it always us running errands?

39:01.880 --> 39:03.380
You're commanding this time,

39:03.630 --> 39:05.010
so call more people in.

39:05.480 --> 39:06.860
I used to be a Nameless.

39:07.440 --> 39:08.820
When I call the guys

39:08.840 --> 39:09.530
to show up and help,

39:09.800 --> 39:10.780
they barely look at me.

39:12.800 --> 39:13.740
I've gone through fire with you

39:13.760 --> 39:14.530
so many times,

39:15.110 --> 39:16.010
I trust you.

39:18.590 --> 39:19.610
You brat.

39:20.150 --> 39:21.490
I know you're scheming

39:21.510 --> 39:22.300
something nasty.

39:22.920 --> 39:23.670
I won't question you,

39:23.710 --> 39:24.460
and I won't stop you.

39:24.920 --> 39:25.530
I'm just

39:25.550 --> 39:26.980
a feelingless killer.

39:28.230 --> 39:29.050
I do the job,

39:29.400 --> 39:30.130
nothing else.

39:31.030 --> 39:31.460
Uncle Zhe,

39:32.710 --> 39:33.860
of everyone in the Su family,

39:34.150 --> 39:35.340
I admire you most.

39:36.550 --> 39:37.460
Don't you die on me!

39:38.150 --> 39:38.740
Go get 'em!

39:40.670 --> 39:42.740
There are three flames on a person's shoulders.

39:43.150 --> 39:44.050
Don't pat them at random.

39:44.190 --> 39:45.010
Snuff them out,

39:45.150 --> 39:46.260
and you really die.

40:01.630 --> 40:02.610
That hunchback Luo

40:03.510 --> 40:04.490
is a pain.

40:05.510 --> 40:06.300
What about the Mus?

40:08.630 --> 40:09.690
Mu Qingyang and Mu Xuewei

40:09.880 --> 40:10.860
broke the line for a bit,

40:11.280 --> 40:12.210
but were stopped.

40:12.800 --> 40:13.900
The Patriarch left.

40:14.630 --> 40:15.420
The others were driven back

40:16.070 --> 40:17.380
by Twelve Zodiacs of Spider Shadow

40:17.960 --> 40:18.570
and vanished.

40:19.150 --> 40:20.130
Back to base now,

40:21.070 --> 40:23.260
and report to Master.

40:23.800 --> 40:24.210
Yes.

40:29.840 --> 40:30.900
Su Changhe.

40:31.800 --> 40:33.170
Xie Fanhua, you sickly ghost.

40:34.030 --> 40:35.530
What a small world.

40:36.630 --> 40:37.380
Looks like you lot

40:37.400 --> 40:38.610
failed at Spider's Nest

40:38.800 --> 40:39.380
and are in retreat.

40:39.920 --> 40:40.780
You're here

40:41.630 --> 40:43.050
to block my way?

40:43.360 --> 40:44.130
No.

40:44.760 --> 40:46.460
I'm just going to take a look at Spider's Nest.

40:47.070 --> 40:49.210
Run into you again by chance.

40:50.070 --> 40:51.010
If so,

40:51.670 --> 40:54.780
please step aside, Undertaker.

40:55.400 --> 40:56.900
You know, I'm an undertaker.

40:57.710 --> 40:58.210
I didn't come

40:58.280 --> 40:59.050
specifically for you,

40:59.110 --> 41:00.210
but since we've met,

41:00.760 --> 41:01.860
I should pay my respects.

41:03.150 --> 41:03.570
You are

41:03.630 --> 41:04.860
a standout of the Xie family,

41:05.550 --> 41:06.260
so...

41:06.840 --> 41:08.170
let me see you off.

41:08.710 --> 41:10.380
Then try.

41:41.110 --> 41:41.900
Why have you been

41:41.920 --> 41:42.940
just standing there.

41:44.550 --> 41:45.210
All together!

41:46.110 --> 41:46.740
Fanhua,

41:47.630 --> 41:48.210
I've been

41:48.230 --> 41:49.610
watching Su Changhe.

41:49.840 --> 41:50.940
I finally spotted a flaw

41:51.760 --> 41:53.130
in his Inch Sword.

41:53.590 --> 41:55.490
Please clear a path for me.

41:55.920 --> 41:56.780
All right.

42:18.220 --> 42:21.700
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

42:21.740 --> 42:25.620
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

42:27.460 --> 42:30.940
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

42:30.980 --> 42:34.820
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

42:36.820 --> 42:40.100
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

42:40.220 --> 42:42.300
♪Still I can't let go♪

42:42.460 --> 42:45.900
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

42:46.380 --> 42:48.580
♪My heart no longer my own♪

42:48.700 --> 42:53.700
♪No one can escape from love♪

43:10.300 --> 43:14.020
♪How many hidden feelings♪

43:14.140 --> 43:18.220
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

43:19.460 --> 43:23.340
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

43:23.460 --> 43:27.700
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

43:28.820 --> 43:31.700
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

43:31.780 --> 43:36.020
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

43:38.300 --> 43:42.300
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

43:42.340 --> 43:45.780
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

43:47.300 --> 43:50.740
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

43:50.820 --> 43:54.620
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

43:56.540 --> 43:59.980
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

44:00.020 --> 44:03.860
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

44:05.900 --> 44:09.140
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

44:09.260 --> 44:11.340
♪Still I can't let go♪

44:11.540 --> 44:14.940
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

44:15.420 --> 44:17.620
♪My heart no longer my own♪

44:17.700 --> 44:22.740
♪No one can escape from love♪

44:30.100 --> 44:32.300
♪My heart no longer my own♪

44:32.380 --> 44:37.420
♪No one can escape from love♪
